            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.36.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 36.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ina peyie eyilou lelo pooki oomanya Misiri aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani. Amu itaa apa iyie eng'udi entiyani te nkaji e Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tinikimbung ninche iyie te nkaina, nigiligili, nipolososo iloilila lenye pooki; naa tenepetaa ninche intae, nigiligili, ninchosho impolosi enye pooki meikirikirata; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "metaa inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ing'ura ajo, ekayau olalem shumata iyie, naa kadung'oo te iyie oltung'ani o eng'ues; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ina kop e Misiri neaku mitil nemeeta toki natii. Ina peyie eyiolou ninche aajo ara Olaitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore amu itejo iyie ore olkeju le Nail naa olalai, nanu oitobira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neaku ing'ura ajo kaarare iyie; naarare inchorroi inono, naa kaitaa enkop e Misiri enkop mitil nemetii toki, eiteru te Migdol ometabaiki Siene, o meshomo abaiki olpolosie le Etiopia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meetae enkeju e tung'ani naim atua ninye, nemeetae enkeju e ng'ues naim atua ninye; keaku ninye mitil ilarin artam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaitaa enkop e Misiri enkop mitil tiatua nkuapi mitili; ore inkanas enyena neaku mijoonto ilarin artam tiatua nena anas naaidaikieki. Ekaidapashaki Ilmisiri iloreren, naidapash ninche toonkuapi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amu nji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ore tenkiting'oto oo larin artam naa kaiturrurru Ilmisiri too loreren lelo pooki ooidapashakaki ninche; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa kashukoki Misiri entonata enye e apake, nashukoki ninche ina kop e Patros, ina kop naa ninye apa eing'uaa; neaku ninye teine enkitoria nashal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keaku ninye enkitoria nashal too nkitoriat pooki nemeitoki ae kata aigil ailepie kewan too loreren; naa kaitaa ninche kiti oleng metaa meitoki ae kata aaitore iloreren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemeitoki ae kata aaku osiligi leina aji e Israel, edamu ing'ok enye, ina kata eibelekenyakino ninche eing'oru eretoto enye. Ina peyie eyiolou aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani Enkai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keisulie olaiguanani Nebukadresa Misiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lari le tikitam o naapishana to lapa le dukuya, te nkolong e dukuya olapa, nelotu ororei lo Laitoriani enatii naajoki: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enkerai e tung'ani, ore Nebukadresa olaiguanani le Babilon neishoo enjore enye metaasisho oleng earare Turo, ore pooki dukuya netabarnoki ore pooki oililai netujutoki aasip; ore ake eyia eitu hoo etum ninye arashu enjore enye ae toki naing'uaa Turopeyie elak ina siaai nataasa earare ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ing'ura ajo kaisho ina kop e Misiri Nebukadresa olaiguanani le Babilon; naa kenap ninye arsisisho enye neitaa ninye enaaruno neidaikie ninye; naa keaku elaata enjore enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aishoo ninye ina kop e misiri metaa olerrinyore teina naisiayua, amu nanu eisiaayia ninche, ejo Olaitoriani Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore teina olong naa kaitubulu emowuo ti atua enkaji e Israel, naa kabol inkutukie inyi tiatua ninche. Ina peyie eyilou ninche aajo ara nanu Olaitoriani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
